@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam RoundCorner 10
skinparam DefaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam DefaultFontSize 12

actor "User" as user

rectangle "MVC Architecture" {
    rectangle "View" as view #E0F7FA
    rectangle "Controller" as controller #E8F5E9
    rectangle "Model" as model #FFFDE7
}

' Flujo ordenado y limpio de izquierda a derecha
user --> view : 1. Interacts / Input Data
view --> controller : 2. Sends Request
controller --> model : 3. Queries / Updates Data
model --> controller : 4. Returns Data
controller --> view : 5. Passes Data
view --> user : 6. Renders UI / Result

@enduml